'''Pomtair''' is an [[NPC]] in {{zone|Dragontail}}. Their quest can be completed by giving them [[Enchanted Bone Meal]].

== Quest ==
If the player is in the Barbarian [[Faction]], the player can give Pomtair {{Item|Enchanted Bone Meal|amount=1}}, and will gain {{Reputation|barbarian|50}}. The quest can be completed once per day.

